      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We present a case series of stenting de novo lesions in anomalous coronary arteries. Our experience suggests that appropriate guiding catheter selection would allow diseased anomalous coronary arteries to be amenable to rotational atherectomy, excimer laser coronary angioplasty or brachytherapy."},
